      "rationale": "P018 states the characterization; P027 explicitly limits causal interpretation."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C028.signal_basis",
    "value": "Reproducible differences in milestone position, waiting duration, returns to active work and time to first publication under common conditions characterize how long trajectories remain at the mapped requirements or readiness constraints.",
    "scope": "Prospective cohort under the same onboarding pathway and observation conditions, comparing like windows and accounting for censored trajectories and accounts with no return.",
